# Day-to-day: ER-ish entity map: entities as rectangles, relationships as labeled edges, one bidirectional.
title "Shop entities"
dir RIGHT
customer[Customer]
order[Order]
item[Order item]
product[Product]
category[Category]
address[Address]
payment[Payment]
customer -> order : places
order -> item : contains
item -> product : refers to
product -> category : in
customer -> address : has
order -> address : ships to
order <-> payment : settled by
